        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>模型60 与二次函数有关的综合问题（1）</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #f3e5d0;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 40px 60px 200px 60px;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 10px 0 22px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin: 14px 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  table {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: 100%;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n  }\n  table, th, td {\n    border: 1px solid #6b5a45;\n  }\n  th, td {\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    padding: 6px 4px;\n  }\n  th {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  td.desc {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding-left: 8px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .example {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 2.1;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .example .no {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .options {\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .options span {\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1>模型 60&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;与二次函数有关的综合问题（1）</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">【模型分析】</div>\n\n  <table>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"width:22%;\">解析式</th>\n      <th style=\"width:24%;\"><em>a</em> 取值</th>\n      <th style=\"width:22%;\">顶点坐标</th>\n      <th style=\"width:16%;\">对称轴</th>\n      <th style=\"width:16%;\">与 <em>y</em> 轴交点</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>$y = ax^2$</td>\n      <td rowspan=\"4\" class=\"desc\">\n        当 $a &gt; 0$ 时<br>\n        开口向上；在对称<br>\n        轴左侧 <em>y</em> 随 <em>x</em> 增大<br>\n        而减小，在对称轴<br>\n        的右侧 <em>y</em> 随 <em>x</em> 增大<br>\n        而增大。<br>\n        当 $a &lt; 0$ 时\n      </td>\n      <td>（0，0）</td>\n      <td>$x = 0$</td>\n      <td>（0,0）</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>$y = ax^2 + k$</td>\n      <td>（0，<em>c</em>）</td>\n      <td>$x = 0$</td>\n      <td>（0，<em>k</em>）</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>$y = a(x+h)^2$</td>\n      <td>（$-h$，0）</td>\n      <td>$x = -h$</td>\n      <td>（0，$ah^2$）</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>$y = a(x+h)^2 + k$</td>\n      <td>（$-h$，<em>k</em>）</td>\n      <td>$x = -h$</td>\n      <td>（0，$ah^2 + k$）</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>$y = ax^2 + bx + c$</td>\n      <td class=\"desc\">\n        开口向下；在对称<br>\n        轴左侧 <em>y</em> 随 <em>x</em> 增大<br>\n        而增大，在对称轴<br>\n        的右侧 <em>y</em> 随 <em>x</em> 增大<br>\n        而减小。\n      </td>\n      <td>$\\left(-\\dfrac{b}{2a},\\ \\dfrac{4ac-b^2}{4a}\\right)$</td>\n      <td>$x = -\\dfrac{b}{2a}$</td>\n      <td>（0，<em>c</em>）</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">【经典例题】</div>\n\n  <div class=\"example\">\n    <span class=\"no\">例 1.</span>（2020·福建九年级零模）若二次函数 $y = \\left| ax^2 + bx + c \\right|$（$c &lt; -5$ 且 $0 &lt; a &lt; \\dfrac{3}{2}$）过\n    $A(m,n)$，$B(3,y_1)$，$C(2-m,n)$，$D\\left(-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}, y_2\\right)$，$E(1, y_3)$，且 $AC$ 到对称轴的距离相\n    等 $n \\ne 0$，则 $y_1$，$y_2$，$y_3$ 的大小关系是（&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;）\n    <div class=\"options\">\n      <span>$A.\\ \\ y_3 &gt; y_1 &gt; y_2$</span>\n      <span>$B.\\ \\ y_3 &gt; y_2 &gt; y_1$</span>\n      <span>$C.\\ \\ y_1 &gt; y_2 &gt; y_3$</span>\n      <span>$D.\\ \\ y_3 &lt; y_1 &lt; y_2$</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
